# superdrastic-<version>-aarch64.tar.gz. Bump both together. This release ships the package in dsflip/.
# 0.5.0-beta.1-rocknixds.8 is .7 plus the open issues after 1.6.1 (SuperDrastic branch
# claude/open-issues-rocknix-nightly-1l4s4w): the in-game menu's own picture per save slot and both screens (SD #4),
# a shader row kept per game, the performance overlay, a brightness slider per screen, menu sounds and tips switches,
# the brightness card on Menu + volume, the microphone's blow detection (#26) and 3x's lines (#47). The whole series
